// Copy to Local.xcconfig and fill in. That file is gitignored: this
// repository is public and the token must not be committed.
//
// Note the SLASH indirection. xcconfig treats // as the start of a comment
// even in the middle of a value, so writing wss://host/v1/stream directly
// gives you "wss:" and a baffling connection error -- and defining
// "SLASHES = //" does not help, because that value is itself a comment.
// One slash at a time is the way out. Do not simplify this.
SLASH = /
SYRINX_URL = wss:$(SLASH)$(SLASH)dictate.example.com/v1/stream
SYRINX_TOKEN =
